        "56": "Repeater, bridge, hub operate at physical/data-link. Option (a).",
        "57": "DBMS: data integrity, security, concurrency. All three. Option (d).",
        "58": "Input devices: keyboard, mouse, scanner. Option (a): all three.",
        "59": "Looping: while, for, do-while. Option (d).",
        "60": "Hierarchical model uses tree structure. Option (c)."
