        "33": "Round Robin gives each process a fixed time slice. Option (d).",
        "34": "SSD advantages: fast access, no moving parts, shock resistance. Option (c): I, III, IV.",
        "35": "Hex and octal conversion: both statements correct. Option (c).",
        "36": "OS: process management, memory management, file management. All three. Option (d).",
        "37": "Space complexity measures memory used. Option (b).",
